  "chunk_seq": 12,
  "chunk_id": "01a0735e-c887-7548-aa18-f1b9e3f5b288_012",
  "doc_id": "01a0735e-c887-7548-aa18-f1b9e3f5b288",
  "text": "## Early Destruction  \n**Some documents destroyed early if:**  \n**Email (non-compliance):**\n- Routine operational emails: 1 year\n- Archived to external storage: 3 years\n- Compliance emails: 7 years (legal hold)  \n**System Logs:**\n- General transaction logs: 1 year\n- Archived for backup: 30 days\n- Compliance/audit logs: 1 year minimum  \n**Process:**\n1. Categorize document\n2. Confirm no legal hold\n3. Schedule for destruction\n4. Destroy securely\n5. Confirm and document  \n---",
  "name": "Chunk 12/24",
  "_domain": "banking.policy",
  "prev_chunk_id": "01a0735e-c887-7548-aa18-f1b9e3f5b288_011",
